g 2; principles/steps 3; application 2; verification 1. Confirm against official teaching material before use."'::jsonb, '"Model answer (8 marks)\n\n**Meaning and purpose (2 marks):** connecting to databases appears in “JDBC Programming”. Define its role and features, relate it to JDBC connectivity model, creating SQL queries, retrieving query results, updating database data, provide a practical example and state one process/design check or limitation. Confirm the details against official teaching material.\n\n**Principles/procedure (3 marks):** Explain the concept in logical order and relate it to JDBC connectivity model, creating SQL queries, retrieving query results, updating database data, error checking. Include the relevant conditions, components, operating variables or formulas.\n\n**Application/example (2 marks):** Apply it to a concrete Advance Java task and describe the expected result.\n\n**Verification/conclusion (1 mark):** Check against the stated objective and mention a limitation, error source or safety/design trade-off.\n\nMarking guide: meaning 2; principles/steps 3; application 2; verification 1. Confirm against official teaching material before use."'::jsonb]::jsonb[]);

